BASE FOR THE EFFECTIVENESS OF

00:28:09.954 --> 00:28:10.889
THE PROGRAM, PARTICULARLY FOR

00:28:10.955 --> 00:28:12.624
PEOPLE EXPERIENCING CHRONIC

00:28:12.690 --> 00:28:13.491
PATTERNS OF HOMELESSNESS. I

